  "scope": "Two fresh heads share the same 1000 V148 batches/4000 observations, local-regret1, delivered-RGB MSE .25, pixel/gradient/domain weights and optimization clocks. Local-control exactly reproduces V156 local-risk trace/raw/EMA/Adam and replays all1644 archived outputs before reusing their storage. Spatial-rgb adds a zero-output four-scale packed-grid RGB residual to the inherited spectral estimator; all shared spectral parameters start identical and train jointly. Native RGB phases have no affine removal, band restriction, support gate, Malvar-only subspace or amplitude bound. Only observed RAW, supplied frozen V143 RGB and physical conditioning enter forward. Parent retains official frozen DINOv3 features; zero new parent/DINO/noise/source/RAW calls. Output units are image-wide shot/read RMS; the new path is exactly zero at zero variance, retaining inherited ADC behavior despite noisy-only training. Features use 16DN floor and asinh signal coordinates, not calibrated confidence. 882 supervised/118 zero-ADC batches, all1000 AdamW/EMA clocks. One fixed architecture; raw/EMA final endpoints, no quality-selected width/scale/checkpoint. 86 prior neural files unchanged plus one new module. Actual noisy-flat/coarse/DC, mixed quiet, mesh, natural and ADC errors, both standing real scenes/priors/windows/JPEGs retained. Real ISO100 references qualitative,not exactGT,never scored. Adaptive reused cohort, not blind generalization or no-hallucination guarantee. New output arrays2.211GiB per local/external SSD, reserve88/200GiB plus0.5GiB projected margin. New study storage budgets preserve all old evidence and old policies unchanged. No dataz access."
